  "verseCount": 15,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "6",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ACT 6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "6",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kuëny lua̱a̱kni da̱ŋ bärɔw",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛn ni̱ni ti̱ti̱ mëë wä ji̱ kɔaar Yecu kɛ mi rëpkɛ ni rɔ̱, cu ji̱ Gɛ-rith göny kɛ kui̱ ji̱ Ɣi-bɛ-ru ɛn ɣöö /ca män jɔɔknikiɛn tit kɛ dääk mi̱thni ni ciaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu jaak da̱ŋ wäl wi̱cdɛ rɛw ji̱ kɔaar Yecu diaal cɔal guäth kɛl, kä cukɛ wee i̱, “/Ci cuɔ̱ɔ̱ŋ ɛn ɣöö bakɔ la̱t ruac Kuɔth päl kɛ kui̱ lätni ŋɔaani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱ ɛmɔ mäthnikä, kuany wutni da̱ŋ bärɔw rɛydun ti tekɛ kɛ̈k mi gɔaa, kä ci thia̱a̱ŋ kɛ Yiëë kɛnɛ pɛl, ti dënɛ kuany läätdä ɛmɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɔn pua̱nykɔ bakɔ rɔ̱ la̱th lät palä kɛnɛ ruaacni Kuɔth.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua ruac in ci kɛn ɛ lat nhɔk ɛ buɔ̱n kɛɛliw, kä cukɛ mɛk ni Thi-bɛn, ram mi ci thia̱a̱ŋ kɛ ŋa̱th kɛnɛ Yiëë in Gɔaa in Rɛl Rɔ, kɛɛl kɛnɛ Pi-lip, kɛ Po-ro-ko-räth, kɛ Ni-ka-nor, kɛ Ti-mɔn, kɛ Par-mɛ-nath, kɛ Ni-ko-läth raan Ɛ̈n-ti-ɔk mi ci rɔ ri̱t ciɛŋä ji̱ Juudh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cukɛ nɛy ti̱ti̱ la̱th nhiam jaakni Yecu, kä cukɛ pal, kä la̱thkɛ tetkiɛn wuɔ̱thnikiɛn.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.6.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu ruac Kuɔth wee kɛ wä nhiam, kä cu pek ji̱ kɔaar Yecu rɔ rep ɛlɔ̱ŋ rɛy Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm, kä cu bööth palä ti ŋuan tekɛ ŋa̱th.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.6.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Käp Thi-bɛn",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Thi-bɛn, mi ci thia̱a̱ŋ kɛ puɔ̱th kɛnɛ buɔ̱m, ti di̱t ti ga̱ykɛ naath kɛnɛ nyuuthni la̱t rɛy nath. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu tha̱a̱ŋ nath ti duɔl guäth palä mi cɔal i̱, “Gua̱a̱th nɛɛni ti Lɔr”, (ala ciöt in cɔalkɛ jɛ) kɛ ji̱ Thay-rin, kɛ ji̱ A-lek-dhan-dri-ya, amäni nɛy tin bëë kä Thi-li-cia kɛnɛ E-cia rɔ̱ jiɛc kä ŋakɛ ŋaknɔm kɛ Thi-bɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä /kenkɛ pɛ̈lɛ kɛnɛ Yiëë in ruac kɛ jɛ luäŋ kɛ ruɔ̱t. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ tha̱a̱ŋ wutni com kɛ tɛ̱̈ɛ̱̈ ti wee i̱, “Cakɔ jɛ liŋ latdɛ ruaacni ti jiäk kɛ kui̱ Muthɛ kɛnɛ Kuoth.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cukɛ naath kɛnɛ di̱t ji̱ Juudh kɛ ji̱ gɔ̱rä jiac nhial, kä cukɛ ben kä jɛ, kä ka̱pkɛ jɛ, kä cukɛ jɛ nööŋ nhiam luɔ̱k. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cukɛ nëën kacä jakä gɔanykɛ jɛ kɛ kac, cukɛ wee i̱, “Wut ɛmɛ /ken ruac jiääkdɛ met pa̱k kɛ jɛn gua̱a̱th ɛ rɛl gɔɔydɛ rɔ ɛmɛ kɛnɛ ŋuɔ̱t Muthɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɔn cakɔ jɛ liŋ ruacɛ, ɛn ɣöö ɛn Yecu raan Na-dha-rɛth ɛmɛ bɛ gua̱a̱th ɛmɛ däk, kä bɛ ŋuɔ̱t Muthɛ tëë cɛ ka̱m kɔn guäl.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min guic nɛy diaal tin te guäth luɔ̱k Thi-bɛn cukɛ nhiamdɛ nɛn ce̱tdɛ kɛ nhiam jääkä nhial.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.6.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
